@startuml
title S-CORE Lifecycle Collector | Static View (HLD)
skinparam backgroundColor #F5F5F5
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #4F5D75
skinparam componentBorderColor #2D3142
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam componentFontColor #2D3142
skinparam packageBorderColor #2D3142
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam packageFontColor #2D3142
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam noteBorderColor #BFC0C0

package "S-CORE (source)" {
  component "Launch Manager" as LM
  component "Health Monitor (PHM)" as HM
  component "ProcessInfoNode" as PIN
  component "GraphState" as GS
}

package "VEL Evidence Ingestion" {
  component "Lifecycle Collector" as Collector
}

package "VEL Evidence Processing" {
  component "Schema Validator" as Validator
  component "Normalization Processor" as Normalizer
}

package "VEL Evidence Output" {
  component "Vehicle Evidence Publisher" as Publisher
}

package "DDS Transport" {
  component "ScoreNormalizedEvidence\nTopic" as Topic
}

HM --> LM : supervision status\n(supervision fields)
LM --> Collector : ext_monitor_notify\n(supervision + exit/error fields)
Collector --> PIN : getPid()\n(pid via ProcessInfoNode::getPid)
Collector --> PIN : getState()\n(ProcessState)
Collector --> GS : getState()\n(GraphState)
Collector --> LM : getRunTarget()\n(run_target: Startup, Off, Fallback)

Collector --> Validator : raw state record\n(score-lifecycle-state)
Validator --> Normalizer : validated raw state
Normalizer --> Publisher : normalized Vehicle Evidence
Publisher --> Topic : DDS publish (reliable)

note right of Collector
  * LifecycleCollector extends SCoreCollector
    (s-core-collector-common-design.md)
  * SCoreCollector extends SourceCollector
    (source-collector-interface-design.md)
  * Read-only: never sends control commands to S-CORE
  * ext_monitor_notify payload:
  * exit_code, process_execution_error
  * supervision_status, failed_supervision_type
  * failed_supervision_cycles, deadline_error
  * heartbeat_error, logic_error, deadline_violation
  * alive_indication_count, process_group_id
  * recovery_state
end note

note bottom of Topic
  Publication topic per lifecycle-collector.yaml:
  transport=dds, topic=ScoreNormalizedEvidence,
  deliveryClass=reliable. Health heartbeat on
  ScoreEvidenceLayerHealth.
end note

@enduml